# English Tech Notes

Welcome to my English Tech Notes repository.

This repository was created for the purpose of improving my English skills while simultaneously studying technology, Software Engineering, Artificial Intelligence, Linux systems, programming languages, algorithms, computational thinking, and technical communication.

The main objective of this repository is to unite language learning with technological education in a practical and progressive way.

Inside this repository, I intend to document:

