- Engineering concepts

This repository also represents my continuous effort to become increasingly fluent in English, especially within technological and academic environments.

I strongly believe that English is one of the most important tools for modern Software Engineering and Computer Science because most advanced documentation, research papers, programming communities, open-source projects, APIs, frameworks, and scientific discussions are developed primarily in English.

For this reason, this repository serves not only as a language-learning environment but also as a technological learning archive.

